OL,3,GNEWSASeven tipper vans dump waste in
OL,4,Afield, says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FA convoy of up to seven tipper vans was
OL,7,Fused to dump an estimated 20 tonnes of
OL,8,Fwaste onto a field, a council has said.
OL,10,FCentral Bedfordshire Council said its
OL,11,Fenvironment protection team was
OL,12,Finvestigating the "large-scale fly-tip"
OL,13,Fthat took place between 23 and 24
OL,14,FNovember, on private land off Dunstable
OL,15,FRoad in Whipsnade.
OL,17,FThe waste included pallets, empty
OL,18,Fpackaging and household items.
OL,20,FThe authority has confirmed that there
OL,21,Fwas "no evidence of asbestos within the
OL,22,Frecently dumped waste".
